      "observed": "Dark choice: theme dark, body background rgb(10, 10, 12), aria-pressed true, survives a reload. Light choice: theme light, body background rgb(245, 245, 247). System-dark with no stored key: theme dark. Follow system clears both localStorage keys. Motion choice: showcase transform matrix(0.9556…) becomes none after reducing, survives a reload and returns to full when toggled back. No console errors, no document overflow at 1440, 390 or 320.",
